 "_about": "RuneScape-style skills of the fantasy world (rules: core/skill_levels.gd). xp needed to reach level L = base * (L-1)^power, cap = max_level. nodes = things in the world you work on (tree, rock, fishing spot, crop); recipes = things made at a station (fire, forge, workbench, cauldron). All numbers are placeholders for the director. gather: how close you must stand, the chance a node is used up after each item, and how much faster each tool tier above the needed one works. nodes.water: fishing spots sit on real water: fresh = ponds and lakes, salt = the sea, lava = the pools of the volcano. gather.reach_water: how far a rod casts from the bank. Names are in data/fantasy/writing/skills.txt. Each skill has an icon (a shape of data/icons.json); stations = the icon of each crafting station.",
